   "word": [
    "compat 14 and 15 behave identically in every case",
    "an authored page break leaves the paragraph mark on its own page; B then NEXT: 2 pages, NEXT at the top with space-before dropped (82.32 for before=480)",
    "an empty sectPr paragraph that sits alone on a fresh page (after B, or carrying its own break) is absorbed: B+S 2 pages, BS 2 pages, E+BS 2 pages",
    "a sectPr paragraph with its own break on a page that already holds a break paragraph still turns the page: B+BS 3 pages, B+E+B+BS 4 pages; B+E+S 3 pages (the empty paragraph occupies the page)",
    "a sectPr paragraph with text, or one that follows B with text, is never absorbed: B+St 3 pages",
    "after any next-page section break the first paragraph keeps its space-before (106.32 for before=480), including B+S, BS, B+BS; only a page break authored after the section break (BS then B) drops it",
    "a real thesis template (not redistributed here): appendix B,BS gives a blank page then the heading (41); acknowledgements B,E x4,B,S one blank page; the table of contents B,S keeps the 24pt space-before"
   ]
  }
 },
